# Rebuild prompt — "YouTube Feed Summariser (Gemini)" userscript, v2.2.1

> Paste everything below the line into a new conversation with a frontier coding model that has a sandbox (Node + Playwright/Chromium if possible). It is a specification, not a transcript: it states *what* to build, the design decisions already taken, the external API/DOM details that were verified or supplied, and how to test. Where something could not be verified against live YouTube/Gemini it is marked **[UNVERIFIED]**.

