## 16. Known unknowns — state these in your final message

Not verified against live YouTube/Gemini: menu injection on current markup, the Ask send problem, transcript routes, the storyboard spec format, Interactions-API image requests, and per-model support for thinking levels/tools/image options (the script drops unsupported options automatically). Free-tier facts used in messaging (Pro and Search grounding unavailable on free keys for Gemini 3.x; 8 h/day video cap; `gemini-2.5-*` scheduled to shut down 2026-10-16) came from third-party sources/search and may change. Google's terms for Search grounding include display requirements for search suggestions that this script does **not** implement. Loading the hidden watch page may register as a visit in watch history; automating the signed-in session may conflict with YouTube's terms. Functional equivalence, not byte-identical output, is the goal.

